          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP445 Fairview&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is another of those curbside caps located in the grass next to a sidestreet in a small town.

The cap has certainly taken a few hits over the years and not much is still legible on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth&lt;/p&gt;

